    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "sourceEntry": 730,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Thank you. So. I was standing in the shower. In the dark. Naked. On the cold tiles. Freezing to death. And I realised....Oh God...I’m still shaking.",
