      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 734,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "He laughed, in a terrifying maniacal way and shone the torch up and down my body. Several times. Then he said….. What big..... eyes, you have. Something like that. Something smutty and puerile.",
